{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"d299c002508a40259e4a799e173e532d3adcfb541d12b74d1f62941cbba20247","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler backend selection infrastructure","key_entities":["ReconcilerConfig","src/rebar/_config_schema.py","reconciler.backend","select_backend()","_backend_registry.py","JiraBackend","register()","_reset_registry_for_test()","adapters/__init__.py","REBAR_RECONCILER_BACKEND","_as_choice"],"problem_keywords":["backend selection","reconciler","configuration","registry","plugin selection"],"propositions":["The reconciler has no mechanism to choose among backend implementations; vendor is implicit in module imports.","A new ReconcilerConfig.backend field with _as_choice validation must accept and validate backend selection at config load time.","select_backend(config) must resolve config.reconciler.backend to a Backend factory via a module-level registry, with lazy import of adapters to avoid circular dependencies.","JiraBackend must be registered with @register decorator; adapters/__init__.py must import it to fire registration as a side-effect.","The registry and config field are isolated from existing consumers (_load_acli, AcliClient sites, differ/apply modules), which remain unchanged pending S4."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787447145201932001,"uuid":"dc0d81f8-d185-46e6-8c5a-9d7a1c02c330"}